### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = kunci-rahasia-futsal

### 1. Root Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. POST Venue (Jakabaring)
POST {{baseUrl}}/venue
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "kode": "VN01",
  "nama": "Venue Jakabaring"
}

### 3. POST Venue (Boom Futsal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/venue
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "kode": "VN02",
  "nama": "Venue Boom Futsal"
}

### 4. GET Semua Venue
GET {{baseUrl}}/venue

### 5. POST Lapangan A (Sintetis)
# Ganti <VENUE_ID> dengan _id venue yang dibuat dari request sebelumnya
POST {{baseUrl}}/lapangan
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "kodeLapangan": "LAP-01",
  "nama": "Lapangan A",
  "tarifPerJam": 100000,
  "jenisLantai": "sintetis",
  "fasilitas": {
    "lampu": "LED 4 titik",
    "tribun": "2 tingkat"
  },
  "venueId": "650000000000000000000001"
}

### 6. POST Lapangan B (Vinyl)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lapangan
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "kodeLapangan": "LAP-02",
  "nama": "Lapangan B",
  "tarifPerJam": 120000,
  "jenisLantai": "vinyl",
  "fasilitas": {
    "lampu": "LED 6 titik",
    "tribun": "3 tingkat"
  },
  "venueId": "650000000000000000000001"
}

### 7. GET Lapangan - Filter jenisLantai
GET {{baseUrl}}/lapangan?jenisLantai=vinyl

### 8. GET Lapangan - Query Kompleks (Filter, Venue, Sort, Pagination, Projection)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lapangan?jenisLantai=vinyl&venue=VN01&sort=-tarifPerJam&page=1&limit=5&fields=kodeLapangan,nama,tarifPerJam,venueId

### 9. GET Detail Lapangan by ID
# Ganti <LAPANGAN_ID> dengan id yang valid
GET {{baseUrl}}/lapangan/<LAPANGAN_ID>

### 10. PUT Update Lapangan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/lapangan/<LAPANGAN_ID>
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "tarifPerJam": 130000
}

### 11. DELETE Lapangan
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/lapangan/<LAPANGAN_ID>
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

